        <h1>Politica de Confidentialitate / Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><span class="badge">FITLIFE</span> Ultima actualizare: 11 Noiembrie 2026</p>

        <h2>Versiunea in Limba Romana</h2>
        <p>Aplicatia <strong>FITLIFE: Calorii, Diete & Sport</strong> este conceputa cu respect strict pentru confidentialitatea datelor tale.</p>
        
        <h3>1. Fara Cont si Fara Servere Externe (100% Local)</h3>
        <p>FITLIFE <strong>NU necesita crearea unui cont</strong>, nu solicita adresa de e-mail, nume de utilizator, numar de telefon sau parola. Aplicatia nu detine si nu comunica cu servere proprii in cloud. Toate datele tale personale (varsta, greutate, inaltime, jurnalul de mese, caloriile, masuratorile corporale si planurile de antrenament) sunt stocate <strong>exclusiv local in memoria telefonului tau</strong> prin SQLite securizat.</p>

        <h3>2. Permisiuni si Date Biometrice (Google Health Connect)</h3>
        <p>Daca alegi sa activezi sincronizarea cu ceasul sau bratara fitness prin <strong>Google Health Connect</strong>, FitLife va citi exclusiv pasii, caloriile arse activ, pulsul si durata somnului pentru a calcula bilantul zilnic si scorul de recuperare. Aceste date <strong>nu sunt niciodata transmise, vandute sau partajate cu terti</strong>.</p>

        <h3>3. Camera si Scanarea Codurilor de Bare</h3>
        <p>Permisiunea camerei este utilizata exclusiv in momentul in care doresti sa scanezi un cod de bare al unui produs alimentar prin Google ML Kit. Imaginile camerei nu sunt salvate sau transmise pe internet.</p>

        <h3>4. Reclame (Google AdMob)</h3>
        <p>Aplicatia afiseaza reclame prin serviciul Google AdMob pentru sustinerea dezvoltarii. Google poate colecta identificatori anonimi de dispozitiv conform politicilor Google Play. Nicio reclama nu este afisata in timpul antrenamentelor sau scanarii alimentelor.</p>

        <h3>5. Controlul Tau asupra Datelor</h3>
        <p>Poti exporta sau sterge definitiv toate datele din telefon oricand, direct din ecranul <em>Profil & Setari</em>.</p>

        <hr style="margin: 40px 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">

        <h2>English Version</h2>
        <p>The <strong>FITLIFE: Calorie, Diet & Fitness</strong> app is designed with a strict privacy-first architecture.</p>

        <h3>1. Zero Account & Zero Cloud Server (100% Local-First)</h3>
        <p>FITLIFE <strong>does not require any account creation</strong>, email, phone number, or password. We do not operate cloud servers for user data. All your nutritional logs, calories, body metrics, and workout routines are stored <strong>strictly on your local device storage</strong>.</p>

        <h3>2. Google Health Connect & Biometric Data</h3>
        <p>If you connect your smartwatch via <strong>Google Health Connect</strong>, the app only accesses your steps, active calories burned, heart rate, and sleep duration to display your daily dashboard and calculate recovery scores. This data is never transferred, uploaded, or shared with third parties.</p>

        <h3>3. Camera & Barcode Scanner</h3>
        <p>Camera access is solely utilized in real-time to scan food barcodes using Google ML Kit. No photos or video feeds are recorded or stored.</p>

        <h3>4. Advertising (Google AdMob)</h3>
        <p>FITLIFE uses Google AdMob to display banner and transition interstitial ads. Ads are strictly suppressed during active workout sessions and barcode scanning.</p>

        <h3>5. Data Deletion</h3>
        <p>You can export a local JSON backup or permanently wipe all recorded data at any time inside the <em>Profile & Settings</em> screen.</p>

        <h3>Contact:</h3>
        <p>Pentru orice intrebare / For any privacy inquiries: <code>contact.fitlife.app@gmail.com</code></p>
